#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn about managing context-based restrictions to define and enforce "
"restrictions on resources."
msgstr ""
"Alamin kung paano pamahalaan ang context-based restrictions para tukuyin at "
"ipatupad ang mga paghihigpit sa resources."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Protecting Qiskit Runtime Service resources with context-based restrictions"
msgstr ""
"Pagprotekta sa mga resources ng Qiskit Runtime Service gamit ang context-"
"based restrictions"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Protecting Qiskit Runtime Service resources with context-based restrictions "
"{#protecting-qiskit-runtime-service-resources-with-context-based-"
"restrictions}"
msgstr ""
"Pagprotekta sa mga resources ng Qiskit Runtime Service gamit ang context-"
"based restrictions {#protecting-qiskit-runtime-service-resources-with-"
"context-based-restrictions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Context-based restrictions give account owners and administrators the "
"ability to define and enforce access restrictions for IBM Cloud&reg; "
"resources based on the context of access requests. Access to Qiskit Runtime "
"Service resources can be controlled with context-based restrictions and "
"identity and access management (IAM) policies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang context-based restrictions ay nagbibigay sa mga may-ari ng account at "
"mga administrator ng kakayahang tukuyin at ipatupad ang mga paghihigpit sa "
"access para sa mga resources ng IBM Cloud&reg; batay sa konteksto ng mga "
"kahilingan sa access. Ang access sa mga resources ng Qiskit Runtime Service "
"ay maaaring kontrolin gamit ang context-based restrictions at mga patakaran "
"ng identity and access management (IAM).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These restrictions work with traditional IAM policies, which are based on "
"identity, to provide an extra layer of protection. Unlike IAM policies, "
"context-based restrictions don't assign access. Context-based restrictions "
"check that an access request comes from an allowed context that you "
"configure. Since both IAM access and context-based restrictions enforce "
"access, context-based restrictions offer protection even in the face of "
"compromised or mismanaged credentials. For more information, see the [What "
"are context-based "
"restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-context-"
"restrictions-whatis) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga paghihigpit na ito ay gumagana kasabay ng mga tradisyonal na "
"patakaran ng IAM, na batay sa pagkakakilanlan, para magbigay ng karagdagang "
"antas ng proteksyon. Hindi tulad ng mga patakaran ng IAM, ang context-based "
"restrictions ay hindi nagtatalaga ng access. Sinusuri ng context-based "
"restrictions kung ang isang kahilingan sa access ay nagmumula sa isang "
"pinahintulutang konteksto na iyong na-configure. Dahil parehong nagpapatupad"
" ng access ang IAM access at context-based restrictions, ang context-based "
"restrictions ay nagbibigay ng proteksyon kahit na may mga nakompromisong o "
"maling pinamamahalaang kredensyal. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan "
"ang paksa na [What are context-based "
"restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-context-"
"restrictions-whatis).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A user must have the Administrator role on the Qiskit Runtime Service "
"service to create, update, or delete rules. A user must also have either the"
" Editor or Administrator role on the Context-based restrictions service to "
"create, update, or delete network zones. A user with the Viewer role on the "
"Context-based restrictions service can only add network zones to a rule.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang user ay dapat magkaroon ng Administrator role sa serbisyo ng "
"Qiskit Runtime Service para lumikha, mag-update, o magtanggal ng mga "
"panuntunan. Dapat din magkaroon ang isang user ng Editor o Administrator "
"role sa serbisyo ng Context-based restrictions para lumikha, mag-update, o "
"magtanggal ng mga network zone. Ang isang user na may Viewer role sa "
"serbisyo ng Context-based restrictions ay makakapagdagdag lamang ng mga "
"network zone sa isang panuntunan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Any Activity Tracker or audit log events generated come from the context-"
"based restrictions service, not Qiskit Runtime Service. For more "
"information, see the [Monitoring context-based "
"restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-cbr-monitor) "
"page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang anumang mga kaganapan ng Activity Tracker o audit log na nabuo ay "
"nagmumula sa serbisyo ng context-based restrictions, hindi sa Qiskit Runtime"
" Service. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang pahina ng [Monitoring"
" context-based "
"restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-cbr-"
"monitor).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To get started protecting your Qiskit Runtime Service resources with "
"context-based restrictions, see the [Leveraging context-based restrictions "
"to secure your resources](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"context-restrictions-tutorial) tutorial.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makapagsimula sa pagprotekta ng iyong mga resources ng Qiskit Runtime "
"Service gamit ang context-based restrictions, tingnan ang tutorial na "
"[Leveraging context-based restrictions to secure your "
"resources](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-context-"
"restrictions-tutorial).\n"
